## CSP Governance Gate — local pre-flight (VTID-03714 diff-only scan)
$ git diff origin/main -- 'services/gateway/src/frontend/' > /tmp/csp_diff_final.txt
$ node scripts/ci/validator-path-guard.cjs --csp-added-lines /tmp/csp_diff_final.txt
No CSP pattern hits in added lines.

First run of this command flagged one false-positive hit: a doc comment
that used the literal substring "style=" while explaining that the new
SVG icons carry no inline styling attribute (the same self-referential
trap VTID-03896 hit in styles.css). Fixed by rewording the comment to
avoid the literal substring — no code change needed, since the actual SVG
markup only uses fill/stroke/width/height attributes, never `style=`.

